WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.680 align:start position:19%
Then came the sentence that turned their
blood cold. I want you to hear it

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:07.680 align:start position:19%
exactly as it was [snorts] written.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:15.000 align:start position:19%
Who has the bedrooms facing the street?
I will know as soon as you move in.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:19.080 align:start position:19%
It will help me to know who is in which
bedroom. Then I can plan better.

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:27.160 align:start position:19%
Let that sink in for a second. Someone
was mapping out where their children

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:30.720 align:start position:19%
slept. I have told a lot of scary
stories on this channel and I will be

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.960 align:start position:19%
honest with you. This is the one that
kept me up.

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:37.760 align:start position:19%
You can lock your doors at night. You
cannot lock out someone who already

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:42.240 align:start position:19%
knows your floor plan.
